Kino plugin "DoramasYT". Site behaviour (listings, the caplist request, the players of an episode and what each server's page holds)
was read from the live site and from the CloudStream provider "DoramasYTProvider" in redblacker8/storm-ext (a fork of
Stormunblessed/storm-ext); no code was copied from it. The packer reader and the request helper are adapted from the Kino plugin
"SeriesMetro" (xuper-plugin/kino-plugin-seriesmetro, Apache-2.0), by the same author.
